{"title":"Scroll Renew","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Skeleton, Goblin Mage, Kobold Shaman</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      <p><b>Teaches</b> Renew, a level-2 Restoration spell. Needs 20 Intellect and Restoration skill 5 to learn and to cast.</p><p><b>Drops from any monster that casts spells, level 8+.</b></p><ul class=\"wp-list\">\n          <li>Restoration scrolls come from any caster, whatever school it casts.</li>\n          <li>The monster’s level picks the spell level: <b>8+</b> drops level-2 scrolls, <b>18+</b> level-3 and <b>30+</b> level-4.</li>\n          </ul>\n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"kobold-shaman\" title=\"Kobold Shaman - dropped it in 1 of 7 looted corpses (1/7)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/7592826f5d8abab1e376.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Kobold Shaman</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/7<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"goblin\" title=\"Goblin Mage - dropped it in 1 of 17 looted corpses (1/17)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/ba717818308d4d0eeccf.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Goblin Mage</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/17<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"skeleton\" title=\"Skeleton - dropped it in 1 of 35 looted corpses (1/35)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/92411ba79e0e60f9798b.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Skeleton</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/35<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"scroll-renew\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/d65310365631cac7ee0b.svg\" alt=\"Scroll Renew\"></div><h3>Scroll Renew</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>3 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/27/2026, 8:28:47 AM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}